@SAPToOdoo_HostAddress = http://localhost:5033
@ApiKey = replace-with-your-api-key

### API liveness (no auth required)
GET {{SAPToOdoo_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Real SAP DI API connectivity check (no auth required)
GET {{SAPToOdoo_HostAddress}}/health/sap
Accept: application/json

### Get a Business Partner by CardCode
GET {{SAPToOdoo_HostAddress}}/api/v1/sap/business-partners/C00001
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-Correlation-ID: test-001

### Create a Business Partner
POST {{SAPToOdoo_HostAddress}}/api/v1/sap/business-partners
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-Correlation-ID: test-002

{
  "cardCode": "C00002",
  "cardName": "Test Customer",
  "phone": "03000000000",
  "email": "customer@example.com"
}

###
